    - Use proper naming instead of letters ( element instead of i, frequency_dict instead of f and     occurrences instead of f function)
    - Implement a check in the beginning of the function to check if the input is an iterable and return False if it is not and not proceed further.
    - The improved code is provided in occurrences.py file  